Stony spikes erupt from the ground in a radius [4, 5, 5, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] cone.

Creatures caught in the area will be cut for [153, 205, 246, 281, 312 (TL1-5; SP 100)] Physical damage dealt over 6 turns.

The damage increases with your Spellpower, and the chance to apply the detrimental effect(s) improves with Spellpower or Physical Power, whichever is greater.
